  "content": "<div style=\"display:flex\">\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge-ecebe6?labelColor=51dcc7&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"130\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available-1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=51dcc7&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"146\" height=\"26\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1104430139275743293.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"129\" height=\"26\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"26\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbmc.link%252firon431\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Buy Me a Coffee-FFDD00?style=for-the-badge&logo=buymeacoffee&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"26\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks 的 Allthemodium 兼容模组</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要安装 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a> 才能运行</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a> 以提供合成配方（可选）</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">添加 Allthemodium、Vibranium 和 Unobtainium 法师护甲与法术书</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">可自定义属性与能力</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/747/823/2023-10-24_12.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"602\"></p>",
